<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 7.1 points to 901.9 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 7.1 points to 901.9 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 7.1 points on Friday to 901.9, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the trade and services index falling the most, down 6.1 points, or 1.85 percent, to 323.4 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
